{
    "id":  11028,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "KIT Silicone Glue + Connector Cable for LED COB + SMD strips - 10mm - 12mm - IP65",
    "reference":  "WIP65-92067-10mm",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eComplete kit for connecting \u003cstrong\u003e10mm and 12mm LED strips.\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eIncludes a 20 cm connector cable\u003c/strong\u003e with press-fit connection for easy and secure power. Additionally, \u003cstrong\u003ea special adhesive and sealing silicone bar is provided\u003c/strong\u003e, designed specifically for LED strip fixation and protection. The kit \u003cstrong\u003ealso includes an end cap\u003c/strong\u003e to ensure a professional and durable installation.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eKIT Silicone Glue + Connector Cable for COB + SMD LED Strips - 10mm - 12mm - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Kit allows you to connect all types of \u003cstrong\u003e10mm and 12mm LED strips with IP65\u003c/strong\u003e and protect them for outdoor use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKit contents:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20cm cable with press-fit connector\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnd cap\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecial silicone for LED strips\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur silicone adhesive is designed for electronic equipment and LED strips:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNeutral, no alcohol, moisture resistant, semi-rigid texture\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResists -55ºC to 160ºC\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAging and weather resistant\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlexible and stable long-term\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRoHS compliant\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFor machinery, electronics, chemicals, hardware\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSuitable for 220V IP65 LED strips in Silicone or PVC, 10mm width (PCB 8mm) or 12mm (PCB 10mm). Does not corrode plastic.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvantages:\u003c/strong\u003e Easy installation, secure and durable connection, protects LED strips against elements.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty with technical data sheets.\u003c/p\u003e",
